      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Phases, average ms per tick (stacked)",
      "description": "Time per loop in each phase of the tick, averaged over the last minute. citizens is every citizen's step (route and job searches inside it), vehicles the buses, trucks and service vehicles, traffic0/traffic1 the car grid and the congestion field, flush the agent buckets and JSON to clients, systems the airports, harbours, finance, issues, fires and adverts. A phase that grows while the others do not is the regression.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 10,
        "w": 16,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 16
